# Recorded fixtures (phoneloop/harness.py). Deliberately not committed: one
# capture is ~9MB of real marketplace HTML and the feed moves hourly, so the
# history would bloat with snapshots that go stale immediately. Rebuild with
#   PHONELOOP_HARNESS=record python scripts/capture.py
# The test suite does not depend on them -- it builds its own in tmp_path.
#
# ANCHORED to the repo root on purpose. A bare `fixtures/` matches a directory
# of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# dashboard/test/fixtures/knob-golden.json -- a fixture that IS meant to be
# committed, and whose absence would fail the suite on a fresh clone while
# passing on the machine that generated it.
/fixtures/

.vercel
.env*

# Local working artifacts, none of which are the project.
#   .claude/         session state and agent scratch
#   .impeccable/     design-skill state
#   .review/         screenshot round output (tools/shoot.mjs)
#   graphify-out/    graphify skill output
# tsbuildinfo is a typecheck cache and changes on every run.
.claude/
.impeccable/
.review/
graphify-out/
dashboard/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
